step Journeyman Skinning
  tip Journeyman Skinning raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and no character level, and costs 5s: train it as soon as you reach 50. The arrow picks the nearest Skinning trainer of your faction. Camp Chair, Forever's camping item for Skinning, is taught from skill 20 (1s, or free from Camping 101: Skinning): three Light Leather and two Simple Wood each, it gives points until 25; placed beside a campfire it gives everyone at the camp a buff for an hour.
  train Skinning Journeyman
  learn 1229517

